# Build outputs that must still be committed -- Roll20 uploads them directly.
#
# Marked binary so git never attempts a line-level merge on them. A textual
# auto-merge of generated markup can succeed and still be wrong, which is far
# worse than a conflict: the file looks merged but the sheet is subtly broken.
# Marking them binary turns that silent corruption into an honest conflict,
# resolved by rebuilding from source rather than by reading a diff.
mothership.html binary
mothership.css  binary
translation.json binary
